{
  "name": "binance-spot-1m-2023-2024",
  "notes": [
    "Binance spot 1-minute klines for BTCUSDT and ETHUSDT, 2023-01 .. 2024-12 (PLAN.md D5).",
    "Fetch with: python scripts/fetch_binance.py --bars",
